{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026B5KQ97GMWU1792835207.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>「萬聖月」第二個周末，尖東舉行音樂派對。</p><p></p><p>尖東麼地道花園掛上萬聖節裝飾，亦有大型公仔予市民「打卡」，未開門已有大批市民到場排隊。下午4時率先開放親子嘉年華和小型市集，售賣「應節」糖果、小吃，晚上就有唱片騎師「打碟」。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN-1700_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026R5kckWKNDG1792836942.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>活動免費入場，每周更換主題，本周是「電影狂想曲」。萬聖節前夕會延長活動時間至晚上11時。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN-1700_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026pdqZUyI4kI1792836969.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>黃小朋友表示：「很多公仔，萬聖節有很多鬼。」</p><p></p><p>黃先生稱：「這裡氣氛很好，所以帶小朋友來感受下萬聖節，周邊消費都會多些。」</p><p></p><p>熊先生說：「很多人喜歡萬聖節，多穿不同衣服出來玩。蘭桂坊比較晚開，早些可以玩多些時間。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:22:52.082652+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":259,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T01:18:49.870095+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:18:10.322851+00:00","content_hash":"ec0bacda0e3fff74df7235b8e4a92d0c48eb51ec713958dbac5417f6c21d403a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}